------------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Presentations of groups
--
-- The relation r_K is not derivable from R₁ = R₀ ∪ R₈₄, so R₁ alone is
-- not complete for O(8, 𝔻) (and the presentations here use R₁⁺ and
-- R₂⁺, which add it).
--
-- The model: each Toffoli-K gate g is read as R g R, where R = I − J/4
-- is the reflection in the vector of all ones (a circuit, Rw), and NK
-- and CCZ as themselves.  R₀ holds, every relation of it being
-- conjugated by R; R₈₄ holds, as its Toffoli-K gates are the
-- permutations X_j and CCX, which commute with R.  But r_K fails: R K₁₂ R
-- is not K₁₂ (their entries at (0, 0) are -1/4 and 1/2), while the
-- other side of r_K is read as itself.
--
-- Generated by gen/mk_indep.py.
------------------------------------------------------------------------

