  (Eq.trans (sound′ e) (⟦⟧ₐ-def ((σ ʷ) (X0 • NKw • X0 • NKw)))))

-- So R₁ is not complete for O(8, 𝔻): r_K holds of the matrices.
R₁-incomplete : ⟦ K12 ⟧₁ ≡ ⟦ X0 • NKw • X0 • NKw ⟧₁ × ¬ (PB._≈_ _===₁_ K12 (X0 • NKw • X0 • NKw))
R₁-incomplete = soundᴷ {k = 0} rK , rK-independent
